/target
**/target
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this workspace builds applications, not libraries.
# Pinning it makes builds reproducible, stops a silent `cargo update` from
# triggering a full rebuild of the Bevy graph, and lets CI cache by lockfile
# hash. (stdb/soils-module is excluded from the workspace and keeps its own.)
/crates/soils-server/data
data/
.claude/worktrees
scripts/.cache/
# AssemblyScript toolchain for server scripts (package.json pins the version;
# run `npm install` to get `asc` so .ts scripts compile).
node_modules/
# Locally pinned SpacetimeDB CLI + standalone (see stdb/README).
.tools/
# Raw OBS captures and the web encodes derived from them (see
# scripts/obs_record.py). The short clip that ships lives in docs/media/.
recordings/
# Generated artifact pages — the videos are inlined as data URIs, so these are
# tens of megabytes of build output (see scripts/build_*_artifact.py).
artifact/
# Obsidian settings are not to be included
.obsidian
*.stackdump
